{"type":"frame-snapshot","snapshot":{"callId":"awic@572","phase":"after","pageId":"page@8cebf1de07e1f511a356687a4211ecbe","frameId":"frame@27cb9e9b21f8478a5e4d44b9ff5fedf8","frameUrl":"http://127.0.0.1:1500/desk.html#health/overview","doctype":"html","html":["HTML",{"lang":"en","data-desk-theme":"light","data-desk-palette":"reference"},["HEAD",{},["BASE",{"href":"http://127.0.0.1:1500/desk.html#health/overview"}],"\n    ","\n\n    ",["META",{"charset":"utf-8"}],"\n    ",["META",{"name":"viewport","content":"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover"}],"\n    ",["META",{"name":"theme-color","content":"#f6f8f7"}],"\n    ",["TITLE",{},"Runalytics"],"\n  ",["STYLE",{},"@font-face { font-family: \"Desk Geist\"; src: url(\"/src/styles/fonts/geist-latin.woff2\") format(\"woff2\"); font-weight: 100 900; font-display: swap; }\n@font-face { font-family: \"Desk Sans\"; src: url(\"/src/styles/fonts/source-sans-3-latin.woff2\") format(\"woff2\"); font-weight: 200 900; font-display: swap; }\n@font-face { font-family: \"Desk Serif\"; src: url(\"/src/styles/fonts/source-serif-4-latin.woff2\") format(\"woff2\"); font-weight: 200 900; font-display: swap; }\n:root {\n  font-family: \"Desk Sans\", sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color-scheme: light;\n  --desk-canvas: #f6f8f7; --desk-surface: #fff; --desk-ink: #18231f; --desk-muted: #59675f;\n  --desk-line: #dce3de; --desk-soft: #edf2ef; --desk-action: #16634b; --desk-on-action: #fff;\n  --desk-blue: #2968ba; --desk-warning: #946000; --desk-danger: #b52f3b; --desk-selection: #e3f1e9;\n  --desk-radius: 12px; --desk-shadow: 0 24px 80px #11251e18, 0 4px 16px #11251e0a;\n  --desk-chart: var(--desk-action); --desk-chart-secondary: color-mix(in srgb, var(--desk-action) 65%, var(--desk-blue)); --desk-ease: cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1);\n  --desk-heading: \"Desk Serif\", Georgia, serif;\n  background: var(--desk-canvas); color: var(--desk-ink); font-synthesis: none;\n}\n:root[data-desk-theme=\"dark\"] { color-scheme: dark; --desk-canvas: #181c1a; --desk-surface: #222824; --desk-ink: #f0f5f1; --desk-muted: #b2c0b7; --desk-line: #3d4841; --desk-soft: #2b342e; --desk-action: #a6e2bc; --desk-on-action: #102a1b; --desk-blue: #96c4ff; --desk-warning: #edc47b; --desk-danger: #ffa5aa; --desk-selection: #293e31; }\n:root[data-desk-palette=\"amethyst\"] { --desk-action: #6844ab; --desk-selection: #f0eafb; }\n:root[data-desk-palette=\"glacier\"] { --desk-action: #1d647b; --desk-selection: #e6f3f8; }\n:root[data-desk-palette=\"evergreen\"] { --desk-action: #16634b; --desk-selection: #e3f1e9; }\n:root[data-desk-palette=\"sakura\"] { --desk-action: #943c65; --desk-selection: #fae9f1; }\n:root[data-desk-palette=\"ember\"] { --desk-action: #9b4925; --desk-selection: #fbede6; }\n:root[data-desk-theme=\"dark\"][data-desk-palette=\"amethyst\"] { --desk-action: #d0b5ff; --desk-selection: #3c304b; }\n:root[data-desk-theme=\"dark\"][data-desk-palette=\"glacier\"] { --desk-action: #9bd4ec; --desk-selection: #263d46; }\n:root[data-desk-theme=\"dark\"][data-desk-palette=\"evergreen\"] { --desk-action: #a6e2bc; --desk-selection: #293e31; }\n:root[data-desk-theme=\"dark\"][data-desk-palette=\"sakura\"] { --desk-action: #f2b5d0; --desk-selection: #462d38; }\n:root[data-desk-theme=\"dark\"][data-desk-palette=\"ember\"] { --desk-action: #f4b59a; --desk-selection: #473329; }\n* { box-sizing: border-box; letter-spacing: 0; }\n/* The gradient is painted on the body box, so the body must always cover the\n   viewport: a short page would otherwise clip the background to its content\n   and leave the canvas colour below. dvh with a vh fallback for older WebKit. */\nbody { margin: 0; min-width: 300px; min-height: 100vh; min-height: 100dvh; }\n/* The app is operated, not read: every pointer gesture here is a press, a\n   scroll, or a drag (a session tile to a new day, the map, the inspector).\n   Starting a text selection mid-gesture turns a drag into a blue sweep, so\n   selection is off by default and re-opened below for the fields and the\n   long-form notes a runner may genuinely want to copy. */\nbody { user-select: none; -webkit-user-select: none; }\ninput, textarea, select, [contenteditable=\"true\"], .episode-notes, .prescription p { user-select: text; -webkit-user-select: text; }\nbody { -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; background: linear-gradient(125deg, color-mix(in srgb, var(--desk-canvas) 88%, var(--desk-blue)), var(--desk-canvas) 38%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--desk-canvas) 90%, var(--desk-action)) 72%, var(--desk-canvas)); background-attachment: fixed; }\n:root {\n   --desk-glass: color-mix(in srgb, var(--desk-surface) 78%, transparent);\n   --desk-glass-border: color-mix(in srgb, var(--desk-line) 70%, transparent);\n  --desk-highlight: #ffffff80;\n  --desk-elevation: inset 0 1px 0 var(--desk-highlight), 0 2px 6px #11251e12, 0 16px 40px #11251e1a;\n}\n:root[data-desk-theme=\"dark\"] { --desk-highlight: #ffffff12; --desk-elevation: inset 0 1px 0 var(--desk-highlight), 0 2px 6px #00000030, 0 16px 40px #00000040; }\nh1, h2, .desk-brand, .desk-metric dd { font-family: var(--desk-heading); font-optical-sizing: auto; }\nh1, h2, h3 { text-wrap: balance; }\np { text-wrap: pretty; }\ninput:focus-visible, select:focus-visible, textarea:focus-visible { box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px color-mix(in srgb, var(--desk-action) 12%, transparent); }\nbutton, input, select, textarea { font: inherit; }\nbutton, a, input, select, textarea, summary { -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; }\nbutton, a { touch-action: manipulation; }\nbutton { cursor: pointer; }\nbutton:disabled { cursor: default; opacity: .55; }\nbutton svg, a svg { flex: none; display: block; }\na { color: var(--desk-action); text-underline-offset: 4px; }\nbutton, a, input, select, textarea, summary { outline-offset: 4px; }\n:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--desk-action); }\n[hidden] { display: none !important; }\nh1, h2, h3, p { margin-top: 0; }\nh1 { font-size: 27px; line-height: 1.2; font-weight: 650; margin-bottom: 0; }\nh2 { font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.3; font-weight: 600; }\nh3 { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; }\nsmall { font-size: 12px; }\ninput, select, textarea { background: var(--desk-surface); border: 1px solid var(--desk-line); border-radius: var(--desk-radius); color: var(--desk-ink); padding: 10px 12px; min-height: 44px; min-width: 0; max-width: 100%; }\ninput[type=\"checkbox\"], input[type=\"radio\"] { width: 20px; min-height: 20px; accent-color: var(--desk-action); }\n/* Native select chrome ignores the field's own colours, so the box is drawn\n   here and the chevron is painted from the muted ink — one control that\n   follows light, dark and every palette without an image twin. */\nselect { appearance: none; -webkit-appearance: none; background-image: linear-gradient(45deg, transparent 50%, var(--desk-muted) 50%), linear-gradient(135deg, var(--desk-muted) 50%, transparent 50%); background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: right 21px center, right 15px center; background-size: 6px 6px; padding-right: 38px; cursor: pointer; }\nselect:disabled { background-image: none; cursor: default; }\nlabel { display: grid; gap: 6px; font-size: 14px; }\nlabel:has(input[type=\"checkbox\"]), label:has(input[type=\"radio\"]) { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; min-height: 44px; }\ntextarea { resize: vertical; min-height: 104px; }\nfieldset { border: 0; padding: 0; margin: 0; min-width: 0; }\nlegend { font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n.desk-skip { position: fixed; top: -80px; left: 16px; z-index: 100; padding: 12px; background: var(--desk-surface); }\n.desk-skip:focus { top: 8px; }\n.desk-appbar { position: sticky; top: 0; height: 76px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr; align-items: center; padding: 0 32px; gap: 24px; background: var(--desk-surface); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--desk-line); }\n.desk-brand { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-self: start; gap: 10px; font-weight: 650; color: var(--desk-ink); text-decoration: none; font-size: 18px; }\n.desk-brand img { object-fit: contain; }\n.desk-navigation { display: flex; height: 100%; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }\n.desk-navigation a { min-height: 44px; display: flex; gap: 9px; padding: 10px 20px; align-items: center; color: var(--desk-muted); text-decoration: none; border-radius: var(--desk-radius); }\n.desk-navigation a[aria-current] { color: var(--desk-action); background: var(--desk-selection); font-weight: 600; }\n.desk-utilities { display: flex; gap: 4px; justify-self: end; }\n.desk-button { display: inline-flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 8px; min-height: 44px; padding: 10px 15px; color: var(--desk-ink); background: transparent; border: 1px solid var(--desk-line); border-radius: var(--desk-radius); font-weight: 550; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; }\n.desk-button.primary { background: var(--desk-action); color: var(--desk-on-action); border-color: transparent; }\n.desk-button.danger { color: var(--desk-danger); }\n.desk-button.icon-button { width: 44px; height: 44px; padding: 10px; }\n.desk-button { position: relative; }\n.button-content { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; }\n.button-progress { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: grid; place-items: center; }\n.desk-button[aria-busy=\"true\"] .button-content { opacity: 0; }\n.desk-button[aria-busy=\"true\"] { opacity: 1; cursor: progress; }\n.desk-workspace { max-width: 1800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px; }\n.workspace-heading { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 24px; }\n.connection-state { color: var(--desk-muted); font-size: 12px; }\n.desk-loading, .desk-empty { padding: 64px 24px; text-align: center; max-width: 640px; margin: auto; }\n.desk-loading { display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 12px; color: var(--desk-muted); }\n.desk-empty p { color: var(--desk-muted); max-width: 48ch; margin: 0 auto 24px; }\n.error-notice { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; padding: 16px; border: 1px solid var(--desk-danger); border-radius: var(--desk-radius); margin: 16px 0; }\n.error-notice svg { flex: none; color: var(--desk-danger); }\n.error-notice p { margin: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }\n.desk-notice { position: fixed; bottom: 24px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); z-index: 20; width: max-content; max-width: calc(100% - 32px); background: var(--desk-ink); color: var(--desk-canvas); padding: 12px 16px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; box-shadow: var(--desk-shadow); border-radius: var(--desk-radius); }\n.desk-notice button { border: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor; color: inherit; background: transparent; min-height: 44px; font-size: 13px; }\n.desk-dialog { padding: 0; width: min(600px, calc(100% - 32px)); max-height: calc(100dvh - 48px); border: 1px solid var(--desk-line); border-radius: 12px; color: var(--desk-ink); background: var(--desk-surface); box-shadow: var(--desk-shadow); }\n.desk-dialog.wide { width: min(900px, calc(100% - 32px)); }\n.desk-dialog::backdrop { background: #0f211b70; }\n.dialog-surface { padding: 24px; }\n.dialog-surface > header { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 20px; }\n.dialog-surface > header h2 { margin: 6px 0 0; }\n.form-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }\n.form-grid .full { grid-column: 1 / -1; }\n.form-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; justify-content: flex-end; margin-top: 24px; }\n.desk-inspector { background: var(--desk-surface); border-left: 1px solid var(--desk-line); padding: 24px; min-width: 0; }\n.inspector-bar { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 24px; color: var(--desk-muted); font-size: 13px; }\n.desk-metric dt { color: var(--desk-muted); font-size: 12px; }\n.desk-metric dd { margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 550; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n.desk-metric small { font-size: 13px; margin-left: 5px; font-weight: 400; color: var(--desk-muted); }\n.metrics-line { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px 32px; margin: 24px 0; }\n.muted { color: var(--desk-muted); }\n.training-context { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; margin-bottom: 24px; }\n.training-context h2 { font-size: 32px; margin: 4px 0 0; }\n.training-context > div > .muted { font-size: 13px; }\n.training-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; flex: none; max-width: 100%; }\n.desk-toolbar { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; padding: 12px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--desk-line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--desk-line); margin-bottom: 24px; }\n.horizon-switch { display: flex; gap: 4px; margin-right: auto; }\n.horizon-switch a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; padding: 8px 18px; text-decoration: none; color: var(--desk-muted); border-radius: var(--desk-radius); }\n.horizon-switch a[aria-current] { color: var(--desk-ink); background: var(--desk-surface); box-shadow: 0 1px 3px #162d2010; font-weight: 600; }\n.date-controls { display: flex; gap: 4px; }\n.schedule-workspace { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); min-height: 520px; position: relative; }\n/* The session sidebar overlays the calendar rather than stealing its width:\n   the board keeps its geometry (no reflow of every lane) and recedes behind a\n   blur, which is what tells the runner the calendar is waiting for the sheet\n   to close. Scoped above the compact breakpoint because there the inspector is\n   a full-screen sheet instead, and a plain class selector would lose to it. */\n@media (min-width: 801px) {\n  .schedule-workspace.has-inspector .schedule-canvas { filter: blur(4px) saturate(.85); pointer-events: none; transition: filter var(--motion-change, 300ms) ease; }\n  .schedule-workspace .desk-inspector { position: absolute; top: 12px; right: 0; bottom: 12px; width: min(360px, 88%); z-index: 5; overflow-y: auto; border: 1px solid var(--desk-line); border-radius: 20px; box-shadow: var(--desk-shadow); }\n}\n.week-board { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(7, minmax(0, 1fr)); min-height: 480px; }\n.day-lane { border-right: 1px solid var(--desk-line); min-width: 0; padding: 0 8px; }\n.day-lane:first-child { padding-left: 0; }\n.day-lane:last-child { border-right: 0; padding-right: 0; }\n.day-lane > header { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; min-height: 104px; gap: 2px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--desk-muted); }\n.day-lane > header strong { font-size: 25px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--desk-ink); }\n.day-lane.is-today > header strong { width: 40px; height: 40px; display: grid; place-items: center; background: var(--desk-action); color: var(--desk-on-action); border-radius: 50%; }\n.day-lane > header small { color: var(--desk-action); }\n.day-sessions { min-height: 300px; }\n.session-tile { position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column; text-align: left; gap: 10px; width: 100%; min-height: 136px; border: 2px solid var(--session-color, var(--desk-action)); border-radius: var(--desk-radius); color: var(--desk-ink); background: var(--desk-surface); padding: 14px 10px; margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: 13px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }\n.session-tile strong { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.4; font-weight: 600; }\n.session-tile.selected { background: var(--desk-selection); outline: 2px solid var(--desk-action); outline-offset: -2px; }\n.session-tile > span:last-child { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n.session-type { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--desk-muted); }\n.kind-tempo { --session-color: #be781d; }.kind-intervals { --session-color: #cc565f; }.kind-longRun { --session-color: #7571b7; }.kind-race { --session-color: #3188a0; }.kind-completed { --session-color: #648470; }\n.rest-label { text-align: center; padding-top: 20px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--desk-muted); }\n.schedule-foot { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 20px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--desk-line); color: var(--desk-muted); font-size: 13px; }\n.mobile-date-ribbon, .day-itinerary { display: none; }\n.month-labels, .month-dates { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(7, minmax(0, 1fr)); }\n.month-labels { text-align: center; color: var(--desk-muted); font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n.month-day { min-height: 120px; border-top: 1px solid var(--desk-line); border-right: 1px solid var(--desk-line); padding: 4px; min-width: 0; }\n.month-day:nth-child(7n) { border-right: 0; }\n.month-number { display: inline-grid; place-items: center; min-height: 44px; min-width: 44px; color: var(--desk-ink); border-radius: var(--desk-radius); }\n.month-number i { display: none; }\n.outside-month .month-number { color: var(--desk-muted); }\n/* Today wears the same filled disc as the week board's header, so the one day\n   that is \"now\" reads the same way in both horizons. */\n.month-number[aria-current=\"date\"] { background: var(--desk-action); color: var(--desk-on-action); border-radius: 999px; }\n/* The day number is a label, not a target: sessions are the things you open,\n   so the cell keeps a clear band between the number and the activities. */\n.month-sessions { margin-top: 8px; }\n.month-sessions .session-tile { min-height: 70px; padding: 8px; gap: 4px; font-size: 11px; }\n.month-sessions .session-tile strong { font-size: 12px; padding-right: 15px; }\n/* The month cell is too small for the kind label, but the done/skipped mark\n   must still read here exactly as it does on the week board: the icon stays,\n   lifted into the tile corner, and only the kind text steps out. */\n.month-sessions .session-type { position: absolute; top: 5px; right: 5px; color: var(--desk-action); }\n.month-sessions .session-kind { display: none; }\n/* Vertical stack: the horizon first, then what the pacing evidence says the\n   plan did with the runs, then the basis paperwork behind it. */\n.plan-studio { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 32px; align-items: start; }\n.plan-basis { font-size: 13px; padding: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--desk-line); border-radius: 20px; background: linear-gradient(165deg, color-mix(in srgb, var(--desk-action) 7%, var(--desk-surface)), var(--desk-surface) 55%); box-shadow: var(--desk-shadow); }\n.plan-basis > h3 { letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 11px; color: var(--desk-muted); margin-bottom: 16px; }\n/* The plan-basis facts read as a two-column key/value table: label muted in\n   the row header, value flush right, the way the definition list did before. */\n.plan-basis table th[scope=\"row\"] { color: var(--desk-muted); font-weight: 400; width: 45%; }\n.plan-basis table td { text-align: right; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }\n.plan-basis .data-table-scroll { margin-bottom: 20px; }\n/* Five weeks at a time: the roadmap scrolls and opens on the current week,\n   so the runner scrolls up for history and down for what is coming. */\n.plan-roadmap { position: relative; max-height: 400px; overflow-y: auto; }\n.roadmap-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 132px minmax(30px, 1fr) 86px 86px 24px; gap: 16px; align-items: center; width: 100%; min-height: 80px; text-align: left; background: transparent; color: var(--desk-ink); border: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--desk-line); }\n.roadmap-row small { display: block; color: var(--desk-muted); font-weight: 400; }\n/* The week's state reads at a glance: past weeks settle and carry their ran\n   km, the current week is the one lit up, upcoming weeks stay quiet. */\n.roadmap-row em { display: block; margin-top: 2px; font-style: normal; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--desk-muted); }\n.roadmap-row.is-past { opacity: .72; }\n.roadmap-row.is-past em { color: var(--desk-action); }\n.roadmap-row.is-past .roadmap-track i { opacity: .55; }\n.roadmap-row.is-current { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--desk-action) 7%, transparent); box-shadow: inset 3px 0 0 var(--desk-action); }\n.roadmap-row.is-current em { color: var(--desk-action); }\n.roadmap-track { height: 12px; background: var(--desk-soft); }\n/* The bar fills with the kilometres actually run, measured against that\n   week's own planned mileage: a full bar means the week was completed. */\n.roadmap-track { position: relative; }\n.roadmap-track i { display: block; background: var(--desk-action); height: 100%; min-width: 2px; }\n.definition-list { margin: 0 0 24px; }\n.definition-list > div { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--desk-line); padding: 12px 0; }\n.definition-list dt { color: var(--desk-muted); }.definition-list dd { margin: 0; text-align: right; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }\n.setup-band { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 24px; padding: 24px; background: var(--desk-selection); margin-bottom: 24px; }\n.setup-band p { margin: 4px 0 0; color: var(--desk-muted); }\n.session-detail h2 { margin: 8px 0; font-size: 26px; }\n.prescription { border-top: 1px solid var(--desk-line); margin: 24px 0; }\n.prescription p { white-space: pre-wrap; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--desk-line); padding: 20px 0; margin: 0; font-size: 14px; }\n.session-management, .session-recording { margin-top: 32px; padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid var(--desk-line); }\n.session-management form { display: grid; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px; }\n.context-note { border-left: 3px solid var(--desk-warning); padding: 12px 16px; background: var(--desk-soft); font-size: 14px; }\n.plan-composer { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 250px; gap: 32px; }\n.composer-summary { padding: 20px; background: var(--desk-soft); font-size: 13px; }\n.composer-progress { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; color: var(--desk-muted); font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 28px; }\n.composer-progress [aria-current] { color: var(--desk-action); font-weight: 650; }\n.plain-list { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n.plain-list li { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; padding: 16px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--desk-line); }\n.plain-list li span { color: var(--desk-muted); }\n.sr-only { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; clip: rect(0,0,0,0); overflow: hidden; white-space: nowrap; border: 0; }\n.journal-toolbar { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; width: 100%; }\n.journal-count { margin-left: auto; }\n.filter-count { display: inline-grid; place-items: center; min-width: 20px; height: 20px; margin-left: 8px; padding: 0 6px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--desk-action); color: var(--desk-on-action); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; }\n.journal-tools { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: flex-end; gap: 12px; padding-bottom: 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--desk-line); }\n/* Filters arrive scattered rather than sliding as one block: each control\n   drifts in from its own offset so the panel feels assembled, not dropped.\n   The global reduced-motion kill switch below leaves them in place. */\n@keyframes filter-scatter { from { opacity: 0; transform: translate(var(--scatter-x, -14px), var(--scatter-y, 16px)) rotate(var(--scatter-r, -3deg)) scale(.9); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }\n.journal-tools > * { animation: filter-scatter var(--motion-change, 300ms) var(--desk-ease) backwards; }\n.journal-tools > :nth-child(1) { --scatter-x: -22px; --scatter-y: 18px; --scatter-r: -4deg; animation-delay: 0ms; }\n.journal-tools > :nth-child(2) { --scatter-x: 16px; --scatter-y: -14px; --scatter-r: 3deg; animation-delay: 40ms; }\n.journal-tools > :nth-child(3) { --scatter-x: -10px; --scatter-y: 24px; --scatter-r: 5deg; animation-delay: 80ms; }\n.journal-tools > :nth-child(4) { --scatter-x: 22px; --scatter-y: 10px; --scatter-r: -5deg; animation-delay: 120ms; }\n.journal-tools > :nth-child(5) { --scatter-x: -18px; --scatter-y: -12px; --scatter-r: 4deg; animation-delay: 160ms; }\n.journal-tools > :nth-child(6) { --scatter-x: 12px; --scatter-y: 20px; --scatter-r: -3deg; animation-delay: 200ms; }\n.journal-tools > label { flex: 1 1 140px; font-size: 12px; }\n.search-field { position: relative; flex: 2 1 220px !important; }\n.search-field svg { position: absolute; top: 13px; left: 12px; color: var(--desk-muted); }\n.search-field input { width: 100%; padding-left: 40px; }\n.journal-workspace { margin-top: 24px; }\n/* Ten rows at the library's own row height, then the list scrolls inside\n   itself while the review inspector stays put. */\n.activity-library { max-height: calc(10 * 88px + 30px); overflow-y: auto; }\n.journal-workspace.has-inspector { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(300px, .8fr) minmax(0, 1.5fr); gap: 32px; align-items: start; }\n.list-heading { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; color: var(--desk-muted); font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n.activity-row { width: 100%; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 30px minmax(120px, 1fr) 100px 100px 20px; gap: 16px; align-items: center; text-align: left; border: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--desk-line); color: var(--desk-ink); background: transparent; min-height: 88px; padding: 16px 12px; }\n.activity-row > svg:first-child { color: var(--desk-action); }\n.activity-row strong { font-weight: 550; }.activity-row small { display: block; color: var(--desk-muted); margin-top: 4px; }\n/* The session's one-line purpose, printed between the name and the date on a\n   matched row; clamped so a long \"why\" never turns the row into a paragraph. */\n.activity-row .activity-purpose { display: -webkit-box; -webkit-line-clamp: 2; -webkit-box-orient: vertical; overflow: hidden; }\n.activity-row[aria-pressed=\"true\"] { background: var(--desk-selection); }\n.activity-distance { text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n.activity-pace { text-align: right; color: var(--desk-muted); font-size: 13px; }\n.has-inspector .activity-row { grid-template-columns: 26px minmax(100px, 1fr) 85px 16px; gap: 10px; }\n.has-inspector .activity-pace { display: none; }\n.journal-workspace .desk-inspector { border: 0; padding: 0 0 24px 24px; border-left: 1px solid var(--desk-line); background: transparent; }\n.review-heading > span { font-size: 12px; }.review-heading h2 { font-size: 30px; margin: 8px 0 0; }\n.activity-review .metrics-line { gap: 20px 28px; }.activity-review .desk-metric dd { font-size: 24px; }\n.route-figure { margin: 24px 0; position: relative; }\n/* The tiles and the attribution strip are drawn to the edge of the host, so the\n   radius has to clip: rounding the box alone would leave square corners painted\n   over it. Same treatment the activity sheet and dashboard maps already have. */\n.route-map { width: 100%; height: 340px; background: var(--desk-soft); border-radius: var(--desk-radius); overflow: hidden; }\n.route-controls { position: absolute; top: 12px; right: 12px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; background: var(--desk-surface); border: 1px solid var(--desk-line); border-radius: var(--desk-radius); }\n.route-figure figcaption { color: var(--desk-muted); font-size: 12px; margin-top: 8px; }\n.route-marker { pointer-events: none; box-sizing: border-box; width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 50%; box-shadow: 0 2px 6px #00000045; }\n.route-marker-start { background: var(--desk-action); border: 3px solid var(--desk-surface); }\n.route-marker-end { display: grid; place-items: center; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #00000014; }\n.route-marker-end svg { clip-path: circle(50%); }\n.flag-check { fill: #171717; }\n.review-tabs { display: flex; gap: 4px; margin: 24px 0 0; padding-bottom: 4px; overflow-x: auto; }\n.review-tabs button { position: relative; isolation: isolate; flex: none; min-height: 44px; padding: 8px 18px; border: 0; background: transparent; border-radius: var(--desk-radius); color: var(--desk-muted); font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; white-space: nowrap; }\n.review-tabs button[aria-selected=\"true\"] { color: var(--desk-action); }\n.review-tabs .selection-marker { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--desk-action) 14%, var(--desk-surface)); }\n.review-panel { min-width: 0; }\n.review-panel > .review-section:first-child { margin-top: 0; padding-top: 0; border-top: 0; }\n.review-section { margin-top: 32px; padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid var(--desk-line); }\n/* What the plan prescribed for the session this run matched — the same\n   description the exported calendar event carries, kept quiet so the recorded\n   numbers above it stay the headline. */\n.prescribed-session { margin: 12px 0 16px; padding: 12px 16px; border-left: 3px solid var(--desk-action); background: var(--desk-soft); font-size: 13px; }\n.prescribed-session h4 { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .06em; color: var(--desk-muted); }\n.prescribed-session p { margin: 4px 0; white-space: pre-line; }\n.data-table-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }\n/* The lap bars are drawn in the palette itself, so switching theme or palette\n   recolours the chart the way it recolours the map line and the pace dots. */\n.lap-execution { --lap-fill: var(--desk-action); --lap-ink: var(--desk-on-action); --lap-edge: color-mix(in srgb, var(--desk-action) 60%, var(--desk-ink)); --lap-target: color-mix(in srgb, var(--desk-action) 12%, var(--desk-surface)); }\n.lap-pace-chart { margin: 20px 0 24px; }\n.lap-pace-chart figcaption { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n.lap-pace-legend, .lap-pace-legend > span { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }\n.lap-pace-legend { gap: 16px; color: var(--desk-muted); }\n.lap-recorded-key, .lap-target-key { display: inline-block; width: 14px; height: 10px; background: var(--lap-fill); }\n.lap-target-key { background: var(--lap-target); border: 1px solid var(--lap-edge); }\n.lap-chart-scroll { overflow-x: auto; padding: 6px; }\n.lap-pace-columns { display: grid; gap: 4px; }\n.lap-pace-column { padding: 0; background: transparent; border: 0; color: var(--desk-ink); min-width: 0; }\n.lap-pace-plot { display: block; position: relative; height: 260px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--desk-muted); }\n.lap-pace-actual { position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; background: var(--lap-fill); color: var(--lap-ink); }\n.lap-pace-actual > span { background: var(--lap-fill); border-radius: 4px; margin-inline: 2px; }\n.lap-pace-actual > span { position: absolute; bottom: 8px; inset-inline: 0; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n.lap-col-narrow .lap-pace-actual > span, .lap-col-narrow .lap-pace-missing { display: none; }\n.lap-target-band { position: absolute; left: 0; width: 100%; min-height: 3px; background: var(--lap-target); border: 1px solid var(--lap-edge); }\n.lap-pace-missing { position: absolute; bottom: 8px; inset-inline: 0; }\n.lap-pace-index { display: block; padding: 8px 0; font-size: 12px; border-bottom: 3px solid transparent; }\n.lap-pace-column[aria-pressed=\"true\"] .lap-pace-index { border-color: var(--desk-action); font-weight: 650; }\n.lap-pace-selection { display: grid; gap: 2px; font-size: 13px; margin: 16px 0 0; min-height: 88px; }\n.lap-pace-selection > span { color: var(--desk-muted); }\n.lap-execution-table tr[data-selected=\"true\"] { background: var(--desk-soft); }\n/* Five narrow numeric columns have to fit a 320px screen without a sideways\n   scroll, so the widths are pinned and the gutter between cells closes in. */\n.lap-execution-table { table-layout: fixed; }\n.lap-execution-table th, .lap-execution-table td { padding-inline: 4px; }\n.lap-execution-table th[scope=\"row\"] { width: 48px; padding-inline: 0; }\n.lap-execution-table th:nth-child(2), .lap-execution-table td:nth-child(2) { width: 58px; }\n.lap-execution-table th:nth-child(3), .lap-execution-table td:nth-child(3) { width: 62px; }\n.lap-execution-table th:nth-child(4), .lap-execution-table td:nth-child(4) { width: 66px; }\n.lap-execution-table td:last-child { overflow-wrap: anywhere; }\n.lap-row-button { display: inline-block; width: 44px; height: 44px; padding: 0; border: 0; color: var(--desk-muted); background: transparent; border-radius: var(--desk-radius); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; vertical-align: middle; }\n.lap-row-button[aria-pressed=\"true\"] { color: var(--desk-action); font-weight: 650; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px; }\n.lap-row-pace { display: block; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n.lap-row-target { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n/* Biased toward the ink rather than the raw fill: the fill is a mid green that\n   only clears contrast on one of the two themes, and --lap-edge is unreadable\n   on the dark one. */\n.lap-row-target.on-target { color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--lap-fill) 55%, var(--desk-ink)); font-weight: 600; }\n.lap-target-band.on-target { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--desk-action) 45%, var(--desk-surface)); border: 2px solid var(--lap-edge); box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px color-mix(in srgb, var(--lap-fill) 24%, transparent); }\ntable { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; text-align: left; font-size: 13px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\nth, td { padding: 12px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--desk-line); }\nthead th { color: var(--desk-muted); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; }\ntbody th { font-weight: 500; }\n.section-heading { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; }.section-heading h3 { margin: 0; }\n.health-verdict { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; gap: 40px; padding: 20px 0 32px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--desk-line); }\n.health-verdict > div { max-width: 540px; }.health-verdict h2 { font-size: 40px; margin: 8px 0; font-weight: 500; }.health-verdict p { color: var(--desk-muted); }.health-verdict .metrics-line { flex: none; margin: 12px 0; }\n.health-analysis { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 320px; gap: 48px; padding-top: 32px; }\n.health-toolbar { flex-wrap: wrap; }\n.health-toolbar .horizon-switch { overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%; }\n.health-toolbar .horizon-switch a { white-space: nowrap; }\n/* Tab selectors wear the applied palette: the selected pill is a tint of the\n   theme accent rather than the neutral surface fill, so switching palettes\n   visibly carries through to every toolbar selector. */\n.horizon-switch a[aria-current] { color: var(--desk-action); }\n.horizon-switch .selection-marker { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--desk-action) 14%, var(--desk-surface)); }\n.pace-insights { max-width: 940px; --pace-mark: var(--desk-action); --pace-band: color-mix(in srgb, var(--desk-action) 16%, var(--desk-surface)); }\n.pace-mode { display: flex; gap: 4px; background: var(--desk-soft); padding: 4px; max-width: 360px; border-radius: var(--desk-radius); margin-bottom: 24px; }\n.pace-mode button { flex: 1; min-height: 44px; border: 0; background: transparent; border-radius: 4px; color: var(--desk-muted); font-weight: 550; }\n.pace-mode button[aria-pressed=\"true\"] { background: var(--desk-surface); color: var(--desk-ink); box-shadow: 0 1px 3px #11251e20; }\n.pace-next { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding-block: 20px; border-block: 1px solid var(--desk-line); margin-bottom: 28px; }\n.pace-next p { color: var(--desk-muted); margin: 6px 0 0; font-size: 13px; }\n.pace-insights .section-heading { align-items: flex-start; flex-wrap: wrap; }\n.pace-insights .section-heading p { margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 13px; }\n.pace-summary { color: var(--desk-muted); font-size: 13px; }\n.pace-insights-figure { margin: 0; position: relative; }\n.pace-chart-frame { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 48px; gap: 4px; }\n.pace-axis-labels { display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; padding-block: 6%; font-size: 12px; color: var(--desk-muted); }\n.pace-insights-figure svg { display: block; width: 100%; max-height: 420px; }\n.pace-insights-figure svg text { fill: var(--desk-muted); font-size: 13px; }\n.pace-point-band, .pace-band-key { fill: var(--pace-band); background: var(--pace-band); }\n.pace-point-grid { stroke: var(--desk-muted); stroke-width: 1; stroke-dasharray: 5 5; opacity: .6; }\n.pace-point-guide { stroke: var(--desk-line); stroke-dasharray: 4 4; }\n.pace-point-range { stroke: var(--pace-mark); stroke-width: 10; opacity: .5; }\n.pace-point-session circle { fill: var(--pace-mark); stroke: var(--desk-canvas); stroke-width: 1.5; }\n.pace-point-session.selected circle { stroke: var(--desk-ink); stroke-width: 2; }\n.pace-point-session.outdated .pace-point-range { stroke: var(--desk-muted); stroke-dasharray: 3 3; }\n.pace-point-session.outdated circle { fill: var(--desk-muted); }\n.pace-insights-figure figcaption { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px 24px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--desk-muted); margin-top: 12px; }\n.pace-insights-figure figcaption span { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }\n.pace-band-key { width: 18px; height: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--desk-muted); }\n.pace-rep-key { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--pace-mark); }\n.pace-session-picker { display: grid; grid-auto-flow: column; grid-auto-columns: minmax(44px, 1fr); gap: 6px; margin: 24px 0; }\n.pace-session-picker button { min-width: 0; min-height: 54px; padding: 6px 2px; color: var(--desk-muted); background: transparent; border: 0; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--desk-line); font-size: 12px; }\n.pace-session-picker button[aria-pressed=\"true\"] { color: var(--desk-action); border-color: var(--desk-action); font-weight: 650; }\n.pace-session-picker small { display: block; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 400; }\n.pace-session-detail { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; padding-block: 20px; border-top: 1px solid var(--desk-line); }\n.pace-session-detail > div:first-child { flex: 1 1 240px; min-width: 0; }\n.pace-session-detail p { margin: 6px 0 0; font-size: 13px; }\n.pace-session-detail .data-table-scroll { width: 100%; }\n.pace-method { border-top: 1px solid var(--desk-line); margin-top: 12px; font-size: 13px; }\n.pace-method p { color: var(--desk-muted); max-width: 74ch; }\n.health-context { border-left: 1px solid var(--desk-line); padding-left: 32px; font-size: 13px; }\n.trend-chart { margin: 24px 0; }.trend-chart figcaption { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; font-size: 13px; }.trend-chart figcaption strong { font-size: 23px; font-weight: 500; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n.trend-chart svg { width: 100%; display: block; margin-top: 12px; }.trend-chart text { font-size: 11px; fill: var(--desk-muted); }.trend-chart details { font-size: 12px; color: var(--desk-muted); margin-top: 12px; }\nsummary { cursor: pointer; min-height: 44px; padding: 12px 0; }\n.risk-factor { padding: 16px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--desk-line); }.risk-factor strong { font-weight: 550; }.risk-factor p { color: var(--desk-muted); margin: 8px 0 0; }\nmeter { width: 100%; height: 10px; display: block; margin-top: 10px; accent-color: var(--desk-action); }\n.consistency-grid { display: grid; grid-template-rows: repeat(7, 16px); grid-auto-flow: column; grid-template-columns: repeat(12, minmax(8px, 1fr)); gap: 5px; margin: 20px 0 40px; max-width: 850px; }\n.consistency-grid > div { background: var(--desk-line); border-radius: 2px; }.consistency-grid .ran { background: var(--desk-action); }.consistency-grid .cross-trained { background: var(--desk-blue); }\n.milestone-list { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 0 28px; }.milestone-list article { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 26px minmax(0, 1fr) 18px; gap: 16px; padding: 24px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--desk-line); }.milestone-list h3 { font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 6px; }.milestone-list p { color: var(--desk-muted); font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 10px; }.milestone-list progress { width: 100%; height: 5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 8px; accent-color: var(--desk-action); }.milestone-list article > svg { color: var(--desk-muted); }.milestone-list .earned > svg { color: var(--desk-action); }\n.pain-workspace { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.5fr) minmax(260px, 1fr); gap: 48px; }.pain-workspace > aside { border-left: 1px solid var(--desk-line); padding-left: 32px; }\n.pain-episode { padding: 24px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--desk-line); }.pain-episode > header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; }.pain-episode header .muted { font-size: 12px; }.pain-episode h3 { margin: 8px 0; font-size: 22px; }.pain-intensity { font-size: 32px; font-weight: 500; }.pain-intensity small { color: var(--desk-muted); font-size: 14px; }.episode-notes { white-space: pre-wrap; margin-top: 16px; }.episode-actions { display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 20px; }\n.episode-chat { padding-top: 24px; margin-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid var(--desk-line); }.episode-chat h3 { font-size: 17px; }.episode-chat form { display: grid; gap: 12px; }.episode-chat form > p { font-size: 12px; }.consent { align-items: flex-start !important; font-size: 13px; }.consent input { flex: none; }.chat-message { padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 12px; border-left: 2px solid var(--desk-action); background: var(--desk-soft); }.chat-message.user { border-color: var(--desk-blue); }.chat-message strong { font-size: 12px; }.chat-message p { white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 8px 0 0; }\n.adjustment-evidence { margin-top: 32px; padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid var(--desk-line); }.pain-workspace .adjustment-evidence { margin: 0; border: 0; padding-top: 0; }\n.proposal-prompt { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 24px; margin: 24px 0; padding: 20px; background: var(--desk-selection); }.proposal-prompt p { margin: 6px 0 0; color: var(--desk-muted); font-size: 13px; }\n.table-date { display: block; color: var(--desk-muted); }.text-button { background: none; border: 0; padding: 8px 0; min-height: 44px; text-align: left; color: var(--desk-action); }\n.settings-directory, .help-workspace { max-width: 900px; margin: 12px auto; }\n.settings-task-list { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 4px 12px; margin-top: 28px; }\n.settings-task-list a { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 30px minmax(0, 1fr) 18px; align-items: center; gap: 18px; padding: 24px 20px; border-radius: var(--desk-radius); color: var(--desk-ink); text-decoration: none; }\n.settings-task-list strong { display: block; font-weight: 550; margin-bottom: 6px; }.settings-task-list small { display: block; color: var(--desk-muted); line-height: 1.5; }.settings-task-list a:hover { color: var(--desk-action); }\n.settings-editor { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; }.settings-editor > header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; padding: 28px 0; }.settings-editor > header h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 28px; }.settings-editor h3 { margin: 16px 0; }\n.settings-editor fieldset { border: 0; padding: 24px 0; margin: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--desk-line); }.settings-editor legend { padding: 0 8px 0 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 550; }\n.settings-section { border-top: 1px solid var(--desk-line); margin-top: 36px; padding-top: 20px; }.settings-editor .form-actions { justify-content: flex-start; }.settings-editor form > .form-grid { margin: 24px 0; }\n.choice-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; }.choice-row label, .palette-options label, .toggle-setting { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; min-height: 44px; }.toggle-setting { margin: 18px 0; }\n.palette-options { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 12px; }.palette-swatch { display: inline-block; width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 50%; flex: none; border: 1px solid var(--desk-line); }\n.connection-summary { padding: 24px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--desk-line); }.connection-summary strong { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 500; }.connection-summary p { color: var(--desk-muted); margin: 12px 0 0; }\n.context-link { display: inline-flex; gap: 12px; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; color: var(--desk-action); text-underline-offset: 4px; }\n.file-path { overflow-wrap: anywhere; font-size: 13px; }.help-articles { margin: 28px 0; }.help-articles details { padding: 16px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--desk-line); }.help-articles summary { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 500; }.help-articles p { color: var(--desk-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px; }\n.native-progress { display: flex; gap: 20px; align-items: center; padding: 16px 0; font-size: 13px; }.native-progress progress { max-width: 220px; accent-color: var(--desk-action); }\n.training-map .route-map { height: min(65vh, 650px); min-height: 340px; }.training-map .route-figure { margin: 0; }\n.health-history { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 28px; }\n.spinner { animation: desk-spin 1s linear infinite; }\n/* Wound backwards on purpose, and only on the sync button: pulling the past\n   in reads counter-clockwise, so the refresh glyph gives the time back while\n   the history arrives. */\n.spinner-reverse { animation-direction: reverse; }\n@keyframes desk-spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }\n/* Every button answers the pointer the same way: secondary buttons take an\n   accent tint and an accent border, primary buttons deepen the accent itself,\n   so the hover always reads as the theme colour rather than a wash of grey. 